  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Keyboard_Insights_SavedKeystrokesLabel\Text:
    Candidate Language=OR-IN: ସେଭ୍‌ ହୋଇଥିବା କୀବୋର୍ଡ ଷ୍ଟ୍ରୋକ୍‌ଗୁଡ଼ିକ
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Keyboard_Insights_SavedKeystrokesDescription\Text:
