  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Amx_ProofOfConcept\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=OR-IN:  AMX ଧାରଣାର ପ୍ରମାଣ
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Advanced_Sharing\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=OR-IN: ଅଗ୍ରୀମ ଅଂଶୀଦାର ସେଟିଂସମୂହ...
