  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Accessibility_Speech_Dictation_UsageOutcomeInfoText2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=OR-IN: ଭଏସ୍‌ ଟାଇପିଂ
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Accessibility_SpeechRecognition_Windows_VoiceTyping_Part3\Text:
